WEBVTT

00:41:28.270 --> 00:41:30.405
when you're trying
to do something like this.

00:41:30.429 --> 00:41:32.556
We're really fighting, right now,

00:41:32.580 --> 00:41:34.776
the greatest battle for our lives

00:41:34.800 --> 00:41:37.287
that we've ever had to fight.

00:41:38.501 --> 00:41:41.168
(Musical interlude)

00:41:51.576 --> 00:41:54.409
(WorkLife theme music)

00:41:58.717 --> 00:42:00.776
"WorkLife" is hosted by me, Adam Grant.